      <div class="td-table">
        <div class="th" style="grid-template-columns:0.7fr 2.2fr;"><span>Standard</span><span>Nature of the connection</span></div>
        <div class="tr" style="grid-template-columns:0.7fr 2.2fr;"><span>IPSAS 3</span><span>Governs useful life/residual value/depreciation method changes as accounting estimate changes (section 8, section 9)</span></div>
