  <!-- ============ SECTION 19 — GLOSSARY ============ -->
  <div class="section-header" id="s19"><span class="num">19</span><h2>Quick-Reference Glossary</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
  <div class="three-col">
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Property, plant, and equipment</div><div class="glossary-def">Tangible assets held for use in production, supply, rental, or administration, expected to be used for more than one period.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item" style="border-bottom:none;"><div class="glossary-term">Class of PP&amp;E</div><div class="glossary-def">A grouping of assets of similar nature or function, shown as a single disclosure item.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Depreciable amount</div><div class="glossary-def">Cost (or a substitute amount), less residual value.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item" style="border-bottom:none;"><div class="glossary-term">Residual value</div><div class="glossary-def">The estimated amount currently obtainable from disposal, after disposal costs, as if the asset were already at the age and condition expected at the end of its useful life.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Current operational value</div><div class="glossary-def">The amount the entity would pay for the remaining service potential of an asset held primarily for operational capacity.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item" style="border-bottom:none;"><div class="glossary-term">Heritage assets</div><div class="glossary-def">Assets of rarity or significance — archeological, architectural, cultural, historical, or scientific — typically irreplaceable.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="legend">
    <div class="ltitle">Financial statement key</div>
    <div class="lrow">
      <span class="badge bs">SOFP</span> Statement of financial position
      <span class="badge bp">SOFPerf</span> Statement of financial performance
      <span class="badge be">NA/E</span> Net assets/equity (statement of changes)
    </div>
  </div>
